    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471340/extras/82a82488ddcc0380f47ab220e744a489.avif?t=1741991416\" data-has-big width=800 height=1992 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Storied Sword is An 8-bit action-adventure where you play as Cedric and Orchid, desperately trying to retrieve the fabled Storied Sword from the evil clutches of the dark sorcerer Vectre!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels include: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interesting Enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Weapon Pick Ups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast Methodical Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Environmental Hazards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Difficult Boss Fights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Birds.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471340/extras/82a82488ddcc0380f47ab220e744a489.avif?t=1741991416\" data-has-big width=800 height=1992 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Storied Sword is An 8-bit action-adventure where you play as Cedric and Orchid, desperately trying to retrieve the fabled Storied Sword from the evil clutches of the dark sorcerer Vectre!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels include: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interesting Enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Weapon Pick Ups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast Methodical Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Environmental Hazards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Difficult Boss Fights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Birds.</p>",
    "short_description": "An 8-bit action-adventure! Retrieve the fabled Storied Sword from the evil clutches of the dark sorcerer Vectre!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cExcellent gameplay mechanics. No collision issues. Satisfying combat. Intuitive jumping. Fantastic level design. One of the best 8bit wall jumps I\u2019ve experienced.\u201d<br>- Indie Gamer Chick<br><br>\u201cThe game is a wickedly fun and challenging love letter to retro classics like Ninja Gaiden and Batman.\u201d<br>- Milwaukee Record<br><br>\u201cWe only publish games that we love &lt;3\u201d<br>- Orc Face Games<br>",
